  "summary": "A flaw in libcurl makes it wrongly reuse an HTTP connection setup for a given",
  "details": "A flaw in libcurl makes it wrongly reuse an HTTP connection setup for a given\nhostname using Negotiate authentication, when the initial request is done\nusing empty credentials. This can make user B's request get sent over user A's\npreviously authenticated connection.",
